## Icebreaker

## NO MORE BOREDOM!

{% arasaac #6537 alt="Two kids playing with a ball" size=400 /%}
{% /slide %}

{% slide align="left" %}
### How do we play? (Instructions)

Today we play together with the ball.

- I throw the ball to you gently.
- When you have the ball in your hand, answer the question.
- After that, you throw the ball to another teammate.
- If you play alone and have no teammates:
  - You just have to answer the following questions.
{% /slide %}

